---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import AmazonButton from '../../components/AmazonButton.astro';
import PlannerCTA from '../../components/PlannerCTA.astro';

const faqSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Does Costco currently list barrel saunas?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Yes. Costco's online sauna category listed Almost Heaven Morgan and Duet outdoor barrel saunas when checked on August 15, 2026. Product availability, price, promotions, delivery eligibility, and configuration can change by date and location."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Is a Costco barrel sauna automatically the best deal?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "No. Compare the exact model, heater and controls, stones, delivery and offload, foundation, electrical work, weather protection, warranty, returns, lead time, and installation. A lower room price can still produce a higher or less suitable total project."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What is included with Costco's Almost Heaven barrel sauna listings?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "The Morgan and Duet comparison pages checked on August 15, 2026 listed a 6kW Harvia heater, sauna stones, and curbside delivery. Confirm the live product page and order summary because bundle scope can change."
      }
    }
  ]
};
---
<Base
  title="Costco Barrel Sauna Review (2026): Compare the Live Bundle"
  description="Costco currently lists Almost Heaven outdoor barrel saunas. Compare the exact Morgan or Duet bundle, heater, delivery, total project cost, returns, and current alternatives."
  canonical="/guides/barrel-sauna-costco"
>
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(faqSchema)} />

  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-amber-700 mb-3">Retailer comparison</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-3">Costco barrel sauna: compare the live bundle, not an old sale</h1>
    <p class="text-stone-500 mb-8">Reviewed August 15, 2026 &mdash; Backyard Sauna Pro</p>

    <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden mb-3">
      <img src="/images/lifestyle/barrel-sauna-chimney.jpg" alt="Representative outdoor barrel sauna with a chimney" class="w-full object-cover max-h-80" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="800" />
    </div>
    <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mb-8">Representative barrel sauna; not a photograph of a current Costco SKU.</p>

    <div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl p-5 mb-8 text-sm text-stone-700">
      <strong>Affiliate disclosure:</strong> As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases. This page also contains an affiliate alternative through Select Saunas. Costco links are not affiliate links.
    </div>

    <div class="bg-stone-100 border border-stone-200 rounded-xl p-5 mb-8 text-sm text-stone-700">
      <strong>Availability boundary:</strong> Costco's catalog, price, promotions, member access, delivery area, and stock can change. The current product page and order summary control. We do not monitor Costco inventory in real time.
    </div>

    <p class="text-lg text-stone-700 mb-4">Costco currently lists outdoor barrel saunas. That makes the retailer worth checking, but it does not make every live offer a complete project or the lowest comparable price. First identify the exact Costco model and included package. Then compare the same scope elsewhere.</p>
    <p class="text-stone-700 mb-8">The old rule that Costco carries one seasonal Pinnacle and always discounts it by a fixed amount is no longer useful.</p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-4">Two current Costco barrel paths</h2>
    <div class="overflow-x-auto border border-stone-200 rounded-lg mb-5">
      <table class="w-full min-w-[760px] text-sm text-left">
        <thead class="bg-stone-100 text-stone-900">
          <tr>
            <th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3 font-bold">Costco listing</th>
            <th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3 font-bold">Published exterior</th>
            <th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3 font-bold">Published weight</th>
            <th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3 font-bold">Listed package</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="divide-y divide-stone-200 text-stone-700">
          <tr class="align-top">
            <th scope="row" class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-stone-900">Morgan 4-Person, AHMOR66RU</th>
            <td class="px-4 py-3">72 W x 72 D x 78 H inches</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-3">685 lb</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-3">6kW Harvia heater, stones, curbside delivery</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="align-top">
            <th scope="row" class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-stone-900">Duet 2-Person</th>
            <td class="px-4 py-3">72 W x 47 D x 75 H inches</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-3">610 lb</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-3">6kW Harvia heater, stones, curbside delivery</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mb-5">Costco specifications checked August 15, 2026. Published product weight is not a structural approval or the full occupied load.</p>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mb-10">
      <a href="https://www.costco.com/CompareProductsDisplay?partNumbers=100481876" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-block bg-stone-900 hover:bg-stone-800 text-white font-semibold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm">Check the current Morgan page</a>
      <a href="https://www.costco.com/CompareProductsDisplay?partNumbers=1781021" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-block border border-stone-300 hover:border-amber-400 text-stone-800 font-semibold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm">Check the current Duet page</a>
    </div>

    <PlannerCTA
      source="costco_bundle_compare"
      heading="Compare the total installed project"
      description="Record the exact Costco SKU, included heater and controls, delivery scope, site, foundation, electrical work, ZIP code, budget, and timeline before deciding whether the bundle wins."
    />

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-4">Use a same-scope comparison</h2>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-10">
      <div class="border border-stone-200 rounded-xl p-5 bg-white">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-stone-900 mb-3">Match these product details</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm text-stone-700">
          <li>Exact room model, dimensions, supports, and configured weight</li>
          <li>Lumber, door, windows, benches, lighting, and weather package</li>
          <li>Heater model, output, controls, stones, and accessories</li>
          <li>Room, heater, control, and component warranties</li>
          <li>Current lead time, return terms, and support responsibility</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="border border-stone-200 rounded-xl p-5 bg-white">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-stone-900 mb-3">Match these project costs</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm text-stone-700">
          <li>Freight, appointment, curbside scope, offload, and damage handling</li>
          <li>Foundation, drainage, anchoring, and site preparation</li>
          <li>Electrical service, controls, lighting, permits, and inspections</li>
          <li>Assembly labor, tools, storage, access, and weather delays</li>
          <li>Exterior treatment, roof or rain protection, and maintenance</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-4">Current alternative: Pinnacle / Morgan dealer path</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-700 mb-4">Select Saunas currently describes its Almost Heaven listing as the Pinnacle / Morgan 4-person classic barrel sauna. That makes it a useful comparison path, but do not assume the Costco and dealer configurations are identical. Match the model, dimensions, heater, controls, lumber, windows, delivery, warranty, and included accessories line by line.</p>
    <AmazonButton asin="B017WJV8SO" variant="primary" label="View the current Pinnacle / Morgan path" ctaPosition="costco_alternative" />

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-4">Four deal-breakers to resolve before ordering</h2>
    <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-4 text-stone-700 mb-10">
      <li><strong>Curbside is not final placement.</strong> Confirm who unloads, inspects, stores, and moves every package to the assembly site.</li>
      <li><strong>The heater still needs a compliant installation.</strong> Have a qualified electrician verify the exact circuit, controls, panel capacity, disconnects, and permit needs.</li>
      <li><strong>The foundation is project-specific.</strong> Use the current room manual, total installed and occupied load, supports, soil, drainage, frost, and local requirements.</li>
      <li><strong>Returns and warranties have different jobs.</strong> Read the live Costco product terms, Costco's current satisfaction policy, and every manufacturer warranty before purchase. Do not rely on a generic claim that one party handles everything.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-4">Primary sources checked</h2>
    <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-stone-700 mb-10">
      <li><a href="https://www.costco.com/opt/luxury-outdoor-saunas" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-amber-700 font-semibold hover:underline">Costco: current outdoor sauna category</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.costco.com/CompareProductsDisplay?partNumbers=100481876" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-amber-700 font-semibold hover:underline">Costco: Morgan 4-person comparison data</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.costco.com/CompareProductsDisplay?partNumbers=1781021" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-amber-700 font-semibold hover:underline">Costco: Duet 2-person comparison data</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.costco.com/wcsstore/CostcoUSBCCatalogAssetStore/Attachment/CustomerSatisfactionPolicy.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-amber-700 font-semibold hover:underline">Costco: current Customer Satisfaction Policy</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://selectsaunas.com/products/almost-heaven-pinnacle-morgan-4-person-classic-barrel-sauna-6x6-ft?sca_ref=10752576.S2huPg7gFg" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener sponsored" class="text-amber-700 font-semibold hover:underline">Select Saunas: current Pinnacle / Morgan affiliate comparison path</a></li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-4">FAQ</h2>
    <div class="space-y-5">
      <div><h3 class="font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1">Does Costco currently list barrel saunas?</h3><p class="text-stone-700">Yes. Morgan and Duet outdoor barrel listings were visible when checked August 15, 2026. Recheck availability and delivery for your location.</p></div>
      <div><h3 class="font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1">Is Costco automatically the best deal?</h3><p class="text-stone-700">No. Compare the complete configured product and installed project on the same day.</p></div>
      <div><h3 class="font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1">What does the current bundle include?</h3><p class="text-stone-700">The Morgan and Duet pages checked list a 6kW Harvia heater, stones, and curbside delivery. The live listing and order summary control.</p></div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200 rounded-xl p-6 mt-10">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 mb-2">Continue comparing</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
        <li><a href="/guides/almost-heaven-barrel-sauna/" class="text-amber-700 hover:underline">Almost Heaven Barrel Model Guide</a></li>
        <li><a href="/guides/sauna-foundation-guide/" class="text-amber-700 hover:underline">Sauna Foundation Guide</a></li>
        <li><a href="/guides/sauna-electrical-requirements/" class="text-amber-700 hover:underline">Sauna Electrical Planning</a></li>
        <li><a href="/guides/sauna-cost/" class="text-amber-700 hover:underline">Total Sauna Project Cost Guide</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
